        <h2>Conclusion & Next Steps</h2>
        <p>
          When facing complex, high-acuity medical recovery, choosing an LTACH with a proven track record of clinical excellence, high patient satisfaction (91.8%), and specialized 24/7 multi-specialty physician oversight makes all the difference. Atrium Medical Center in Stafford, Texas remains committed to walking alongside every patient and family on their journey to wellness.
        </p>

